@PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5016

### Read portfolio sample
GET {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/portfolio
Accept: application/json

### Check admin login configuration and current session
GET {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/session
Accept: application/json

### Start Telegram Login (requires BotFather configuration)
GET {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/login

### Logout (requires the admin cookie)
POST {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/logout

###
